WEBVTT

00:05:27.676 --> 00:05:32.636
And after some weeks,
12,000 Germans had signed up

00:05:32.676 --> 00:05:35.156
to meet someone else
with a different opinion.

00:05:35.196 --> 00:05:36.676
So we had a problem.

00:05:36.676 --> 00:05:38.796
(Laughter)

00:05:38.836 --> 00:05:41.676
We hacked a quick and dirty algorithm

00:05:41.716 --> 00:05:44.796
that would find
the perfect Tinder matches,

00:05:44.836 --> 00:05:49.316
like people living as close as possible
having answered the questions

00:05:49.356 --> 00:05:51.316
as differently as possible.

00:05:52.316 --> 00:05:54.956
We introduced them via email.

00:05:55.756 --> 00:05:59.516
And, as you may imagine,
we had many concerns.